Third-party dependencies
========================

Rust crates and npm packages used by OpenVAIR keep their own licenses. The
exact versions are pinned in Cargo.lock, client/Cargo.lock,
web/package-lock.json and client/package-lock.json. The licenses accepted
for Rust dependencies are listed in deny.toml and client/deny.toml and are
checked in CI with cargo-deny.
